                                "sense_id": "9240e993-c960-3bde-9fc1-e60416bb6785",
                                "text": "But the antinationalist demonstrations that followed Mr. Dink’s killing also surfaced in places as diverse as Izmir, the Aegean coastal city that is Turkey’s third largest, and in Sanliurfa and Hatay, which are close to Turkey’s eastern border with Syria."
                            },
